# The build context is the repository root. BuildKit reads this file (named
# after the Dockerfile) instead of a root .dockerignore.
#
# Allow-list: the workspace manifest, Navree's crates and this app. Everything
# else stays out: target/, apps/ (crm-api, crm-web with node_modules and
# .next), docs/, bench/results, the other frameworks, .git, .playwright-mcp,
# storage and SQLite files.
*
!Cargo.toml
!crates
!bench/frameworks/navree

# Never needed inside the allowed directories either.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/storage
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
crates/*/tests
crates/*/benches
crates/*/examples
bench/frameworks/navree/README.md
